OL,3,GNEWSAHow Merseyside Police is promising
OL,4,Ato tackle knife crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerseyside Police is planning to
OL,7,Fincrease surveillance in two areas of
OL,8,FLiverpool in its fight against knife
OL,9,Fcrime.
OL,11,FMore patrols, CCTV upgrades and live
OL,12,Ffacial recognition technology
OL,13,Fdeployments are among the measures
OL,14,Fplanned for Liverpool city centre and
OL,15,FSheil Road in Kensington.
OL,17,FThe force said it was investing
OL,18,F#700,000 from the Home Office's knife
OL,19,Fcrime concentration fund to target
OL,20,Fcrimes including robbery, assault and
OL,21,Ftheft in which knives are used.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
